  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T15:57:01.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 22366,
  "properties": {
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Community Volunteer Finder</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script src=\"script.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <main class=\"container\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Community Volunteer Finder</h1>\n      <p>Find an opportunity that matches your interests and age.</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"controls\">\n      <label for=\"categorySelect\">Category:</label>\n      <select id=\"categorySelect\">\n        <option value=\"all\">Any</option>\n        <option value=\"Environment\">Environment</option>\n        <option value=\"Education\">Education</option>\n        <option value=\"Health\">Health</option>\n      </select>\n\n      <label class=\"checkbox-label\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ageGate\">\n        Suitable for Ages 12+\n      </label>\n\n      <button id=\"applyBtn\">Find Roles</button>\n    </section>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <section class=\"results-summary\">\n      <p>\n        <span id=\"filterLabel\">Showing all roles...</span>\n        (<span id=\"resultCount\">10</span> results)\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <div id=\"results\"></div>\n    \n    <p id=\"noResults\" class=\"hidden\">No opportunities match these criteria.</p>\n\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* Base Styles */\nbody {\n  font-family: sans-serif;\n  background-color: #f4f4f9;\n  color: #333;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.container {\n  max-width: 600px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  background: white;\n  padding: 20px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: #2c3e50;\n}\n\n/* Controls */\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nselect, button {\n  padding: 8px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  background-color: #3498db;\n  color: white;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  margin-top: 10px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background-color: #2980b9;\n}\n\n.checkbox-label {\n  font-weight: normal;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n}\n\n/* Results Area */\n.results-summary {\n  font-style: italic;\n  color: #555;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  padding: 15px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  background-color: #fff;\n}\n\n.card h3 {\n  margin-top: 0;\n  color: #e67e22;\n}\n\n.tag {\n  background-color: #eee;\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n/* Utility */\n.hidden {\n  display: none;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// DATASET (10 items)\nconst opportunities = [\n  // Environment\n  { role: \"Park Cleanup\", category: \"Environment\", minAge: 6, remote: false },\n  { role: \"Tree Planting\", category: \"Environment\", minAge: 12, remote: false },\n  { role: \"River Water Testing\", category: \"Environment\", minAge: 14, remote: false },\n  { role: \"Recycling Sorter\", category: \"Environment\", minAge: 10, remote: false },\n  \n  // Education\n  { role: \"Library Helper\", category: \"Education\", minAge: 10, remote: false },\n  { role: \"Coding Mentor\", category: \"Education\", minAge: 15, remote: true },\n  { role: \"Math Tutor\", category: \"Education\", minAge: 16, remote: true },\n\n  // Health\n  { role: \"Hospital Greeter\", category: \"Health\", minAge: 18, remote: false },\n  { role: \"Food Bank Packer\", category: \"Health\", minAge: 8, remote: false },\n  { role: \"Senior Center Reader\", category: \"Health\", minAge: 13, remote: false }\n];\n\n// Select DOM elements\nconst applyBtn = document.querySelector(\"#applyBtn\");\nconst categorySelect = document.querySelector(\"#categorySelect\");\nconst ageCheckbox = document.querySelector(\"#ageGate\"); // Updated ID\nconst resultsContainer = document.querySelector(\"#results\");\nconst filterLabel = document.querySelector(\"#filterLabel\");\nconst resultCount = document.querySelector(\"#resultCount\");\nconst noResultsMsg = document.querySelector(\"#noResults\");\n\n// MAIN FILTER FUNCTION\n\n\n\n\n// HELPER: UPDATE THE TEXT EXPLAINING THE ACTIVE FILTER \n\n\n\n\n\n// HELPER: RENDER THE LIST OF CARDS\n\n\n\n\n\n// Initial Load\n// Render all cards initially\nrenderCards(opportunities);\n\n// Event Listeners\nif(applyBtn) {\n  applyBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", applyFilter);\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3",
        "1",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Filtering with Boolean Logic\r\n\r\n1.  **Write the Filter:** Inside the `applyFilter` function, look for the `opportunities.filter()` method and complete it.\r\n2.  **Define the Logic:** Inside the filter function, create two checks using variables:\r\n    * **Category:** Filter by Environment, Education, or Health \r\n    * **Age:** Check if the \"Suitable for Ages 12+\" box is checked or not.\r\n    * **Return:** Return the result of the Category check **AND** (`&&`) the Age check.\r\n3.  **Update Transparency:** In the `updateTransparency` function, use `if/else` statements to build a description string (e.g., \"Showing Health roles suitable for ages 12+\"). Assign this text to `filterLabel.textContent` so the user knows exactly what criteria are active.\r\n4.  **Test:** Run the code. Select a category or age filter and click `Find Roles` to test out the different filters.",
